        "transport-object :parameters (?character - character ?item - (either item device dress) ?from - place ?to - place) :precondition (and (alive ?character) (at ?character ?from) (has ?character ?item) (requested-tow ?character ?to)) :effect (and (not (at ?character ?from)) (at ?character ?to) (not (has ?character ?item))))": "(:action transport-object :parameters (?character - character ?item - (either item device dress) ?from - place ?to - place) :precondition (and (alive ?character) (at ?character ?from) (has ?character ?item) (requested-tow ?character ?to)) :effect (and (not (at ?character ?from)) (at ?character ?to) (not (has ?character ?item))))",
